WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.740
POSITION returns the location of one substring
inside another It is

00:00:05.766 --> 00:00:11.479
useful when you need to know whether a delimiter
exists or where it occurs For

00:00:11.505 --> 00:00:17.426
many parsing tasks SPLIT_PART is clearer when the
delimiter already defines meaningful parts

00:00:19.147 --> 00:00:22.765
POSITION is especially useful during inspection and
validation
